DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
1039::$$$message_0005_0000_0000$$$::"...What the?"[lr]::
1040::$$$message_0005_0000_0001$$$::I open the refrigerator to start prepping lunch, only to find it packed with ingredients I don't recognize.[lr]::
1041::$$$message_0005_0000_0002$$$::No one's gone shopping today, so whose work is this?[se storage=se506.wav]::
1042::$$$message_0005_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou, I have a message from Taiga.[lr]::
1043::$$$message_0005_0001_0001$$$::She said, 'I brought some tasty-looking stuff over, so I leave the rest to you.'"[lr]::
1044::$$$message_0005_0001_0002$$$::"Hahaha. Yeah, I figured."::
1045::$$$message_0005_0002_0000$$$::The culprit was Fuji-nee, just as I suspected. One mystery solved in record time.[lr]::
1046::$$$message_0005_0002_0001$$$::...Well, I can make a lot of different things with all these ingredients, so what to do...::
1047::$$$message_0005_0003_0000$$$::"Hey, you two. What do you want to eat for lunch?"[lr]::
1048::$$$message_0005_0003_0001$$$::"No strong preference at this time. I don't have any objections to anything you cook."[lr]::
1049::$$$message_0005_0003_0002$$$::Hmmm.[lr]::
1050::$$$message_0005_0003_0003$$$::For now, I'll make a mental note that Saber's fine with anything.::
1051::$$$message_0005_0004_0000$$$::"What about you, Rider?"[lr]::
1052::$$$message_0005_0004_0001$$$::Rider won this morning's TV channel struggle and is now watching a national news broadcast.::
1053::$$$message_0005_0005_0000$$$::"I have no particular preference."[lr]::
1054::$$$message_0005_0005_0001$$$::"Hmmm."[lr]::
1055::$$$message_0005_0005_0002$$$::I half expected this, but she says the same thing.[lr]::
1056::$$$message_0005_0005_0003$$$::Which means it falls to me to decide...::
1057::$$$message_0005_0006_0000$$$::"Hey, Rider. I've been wondering for a while, but do you not have anything you like to eat?"[lr]::
1058::$$$message_0005_0006_0001$$$::"What do you mean?"[lr]::
1059::$$$message_0005_0006_0002$$$::"Well, you always eat quietly.[lr]::
1060::$$$message_0005_0006_0003$$$::I just hope we aren't pressuring you into eating something you don't like."::
1061::$$$message_0005_0007_0000$$$::Fuji-nee and Illya let me know immediately when they don't like something. In fact, they don't even try to eat it.[lr]::
1062::$$$message_0005_0007_0001$$$::Sakura and Tohsaka both cook and give me their opinions about the food. Saber requires no explanation.[lr]::
1063::$$$message_0005_0007_0002$$$::But, I've never heard Rider give an opinion about the food.::
1064::$$$message_0005_0008_0000$$$::"Shirou, if you are trying to tell me something, please say it clearly."[lr]::
1065::$$$message_0005_0008_0001$$$::"It's not that I'm trying to say anything...[lr]::
1066::$$$message_0005_0008_0002$$$::But you're always happy to eat whatever I cook, so it's easy to come up with a menu for you."::
1067::$$$message_0005_0009_0000$$$::"W-what do you mean, Shirou?[lr]::
1068::$$$message_0005_0009_0001$$$::That makes it sound like I don't have any composure when I eat!"[lr]::
1069::$$$message_0005_0009_0002$$$::"You call that composed?"::
1070::$$$message_0005_0010_0000$$$::"O-of course I do.[lr]::
1071::$$$message_0005_0010_0001$$$::...How rude. What does it look like to you, then?"[lr]::
1072::$$$message_0005_0010_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
1073::$$$message_0005_0010_0003$$$::Rider exercises her right to silence.[lr]::
1074::$$$message_0005_0010_0004$$$::Thank goodness.[lr]::
1075::$$$message_0005_0010_0005$$$::I'm really glad that Rider's a mature adult.::
1076::$$$message_0005_0011_0000$$$::"Uh...back to the topic of likes and dislikes.[lr]::
1077::$$$message_0005_0011_0001$$$::Have you been forcing yourself not to share your opinion?"[lr]::
1078::$$$message_0005_0011_0002$$$::"Not particularly.[lr]::
1079::$$$message_0005_0011_0003$$$::Was I making you worried?"[lr]::
1080::$$$message_0005_0011_0004$$$::"Just a little. If you at least reacted openly like Saber does, it would be easier for me to understand."::
1081::$$$message_0005_0012_0000$$$::"Shirou! Are you taking her side!?"[lr]::
1082::$$$message_0005_0012_0001$$$::"I just said that it's easier for me because you're sincere about liking the food.[lr]::
1083::$$$message_0005_0012_0002$$$::And Rider, Saber does have good table manners."[lr]::
1084::$$$message_0005_0012_0003$$$::Saber nods smugly.[lr]::
1085::$$$message_0005_0012_0004$$$::No matter how rushed Saber feels, she never moves her chopsticks any faster.::
1086::$$$message_0005_0013_0000$$$::"You say that it's easier to cook if you know what we like and dislike.[lr]::
1087::$$$message_0005_0013_0001$$$::I understand that, but like Saber, I am satisfied with whatever you and Sakura make.[lr]::
1088::$$$message_0005_0013_0002$$$::That's why I don't think your concern is warranted."[lr]::
1089::$$$message_0005_0013_0003$$$::Hrm. I'm grateful for the thought, but we're getting nowhere.::
1090::$$$message_0005_0014_0000$$$::"Okay, let's try a different approach.[lr]::
1091::$$$message_0005_0014_0001$$$::Is there anything you refuse to eat, Rider?"[lr]::
1092::$$$message_0005_0014_0002$$$::"...So it's come to this."::
1093::$$$message_0005_0015_0000$$$::"Let me think... Most likely,[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服04e(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服04e(中) textoff=0] nothing that you would cook applies."[lr]::
1094::$$$message_0005_0015_0001$$$::"Oh. So there is something?"[lr]::
1095::$$$message_0005_0015_0002$$$::"Yes, although snake meat is not commonly served in this country, I believe."::
1096::$$$message_0005_0016_0000$$$::...I see. Considering Rider's identity, she wouldn't like eating that.[lr]::
1097::$$$message_0005_0016_0001$$$::On that note, her class and Noble Phantasm give me another idea.::
1098::$$$message_0005_0017_0000$$$::"Rider, do you dislike eating horse, too?"[lr]::
1099::$$$message_0005_0017_0001$$$::"Yes. I don't dislike the meat itself, but..."[lr]::
1100::$$$message_0005_0017_0002$$$::"I get it. Snake isn't very common here, but I'll be careful about horse."::
1101::$$$message_0005_0018_0000$$$::"Shirou, then should we not ask Taiga to take back the snake wine she brought over the other day?"[lr]::
1102::$$$message_0005_0018_0001$$$::"Snake wine... Fuji-nee brought something like that over?"::
1103::$$$message_0005_0019_0000$$$::Saber nods, and then goes into the kitchen and opens the cabinet under the sink.[lr]::
1104::$$$message_0005_0019_0001$$$::A bottle with a snake inside of it is there.::
1105::$$$message_0005_0020_0000$$$::"She was happily flaunting it before Sakura and I.[lr]::
1106::$$$message_0005_0020_0001$$$::She said that it would be boring if she didn't scare someone with it, so she left it here."[lr]::
1107::$$$message_0005_0020_0002$$$::"...I'm glad you remembered.[lr]::
1108::$$$message_0005_0020_0003$$$::Are you okay with those two things, Saber?"[lr]::
1109::$$$message_0005_0020_0004$$$::That's probably a habu viper in the bottle. I ask her as I put it away deeper in the cabinet.::
1110::$$$message_0005_0021_0000$$$::"Yes. I have no objection to eating them.[lr]::
1111::$$$message_0005_0021_0001$$$::...Of course, I don't intend to eat them in front of someone who wouldn't like to see that."[lr]::
1112::$$$message_0005_0021_0002$$$::"I understand. But I won't be having any snake or horse in this house."[lr]::
1113::$$$message_0005_0021_0003$$$::Saber and Rider often don't see eye to eye.[lr]::
1114::$$$message_0005_0021_0004$$$::They do, however, show a certain friendly consideration for one another.::
1115::$$$message_0005_0022_0000$$$::"Okay, okay, I've got it.[lr]::
1116::$$$message_0005_0022_0001$$$::Rider, come over here, would you?"[lr]::
1117::$$$message_0005_0022_0002$$$::I beckon Rider closer.[lr]::
1118::$$$message_0005_0022_0003$$$::It's a little cramped in the kitchen for all three of us, but Saber makes no sign of leaving.::
1119::$$$message_0005_0023_0000$$$::"Pick something you'd like to eat from in here."[lr]::
1120::$$$message_0005_0023_0001$$$::I open the refrigerator.[lr]::
1121::$$$message_0005_0023_0002$$$::"Are you asking me to select ingredients for lunch?"[lr]::
1122::$$$message_0005_0023_0003$$$::"Yeah. Pick anything you want."[lr]::
1123::$$$message_0005_0023_0004$$$::"I see.[lr]::
1124::$$$message_0005_0023_0005$$$::Then..."::
1125::$$$message_0005_0024_0000$$$::Rider scans the contents with a serious expression. Saber watches her from behind.::
1126::$$$message_0005_0025_0000$$$::"...You're very kind to Rider."[lr]::
1127::$$$message_0005_0025_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
1128::$$$message_0005_0025_0002$$$::Is she upset that I asked Rider her opinion first?::
1129::$$$message_0005_0026_0000$$$::"What are you talking about, Saber? It's easier to cook if I know what people like or dislike.[lr]::
1130::$$$message_0005_0026_0001$$$::And I've asked you lots of times before."[lr]::
1131::$$$message_0005_0026_0002$$$::"...That's true."::
1132::$$$message_0005_0027_0000$$$::"Shirou, what is this?"[lr]::
1133::$$$message_0005_0027_0001$$$::I turn back to Rider, who's pointing at a foam container.[lr]::
1134::$$$message_0005_0027_0002$$$::The lid is labeled "RAW: KEEP REFRIGERATED" I assume it's fish or something of the like.::
1135::$$$message_0005_0028_0000$$$::"I think that one is...octopus."[lr]::
1136::$$$message_0005_0028_0001$$$::"It appears so."[lr]::
1137::$$$message_0005_0028_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
1138::$$$message_0005_0028_0003$$$::I try to remove it from the box, [wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=10 top=75 time=300 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]but its suckers are stuck to the inside, and I can't quite peel it off.[wm canskip=0]::
1139::$$$message_0005_0029_0000$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-70 top=75 time=400 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0][resumevoice]This thing's pretty feisty."[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02a(中)][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-50 top=75 time=300 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0][wvs][wm canskip=0][lr]::
1140::$$$message_0005_0029_0001$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 left=-130 top=75 time=400 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0][resumevoice]Why don't we have this for lunch? [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服02a(中)][wvl][wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-110 top=75 time=300 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]I think it would be best to consume it while it's still fresh.[wm canskip=0]"[lr]::
1141::$$$message_0005_0029_0002$$$::[movefg opacity=255 left=-192 top=75 time=400 accel=2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]True, it would taste better if we [wm canskip=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-172 top=75 time=300 accel=-2 storage=セイバー私服06b腕b(中) textoff=0]used it today[wm canskip=0].::
1142::$$$message_0005_0030_0000$$$::"Okay, then what should I make with it... Saber, why are you standing all the way over there?"[lr]::
1143::$$$message_0005_0030_0001$$$::For some reason, Saber is watching us from the corner of the kitchen.::
1144::$$$message_0005_0031_0000$$$::"Shirou, are we really going to eat that?"[lr]::
1145::$$$message_0005_0031_0001$$$::"Yeah. That's what I'm thinking... Is something the matter?"[lr]::
1146::$$$message_0005_0031_0002$$$::"No, well..."::
1147::$$$message_0005_0032_0000$$$::Saber's attitude shift is noticeable.[lr]::
1148::$$$message_0005_0032_0001$$$::If I consider what the cause might be, suspect number one has got to be the thing stuck to my hand.::
1149::$$$message_0005_0033_0000$$$::"Do you dislike octopus?"[lr]::
1150::$$$message_0005_0033_0001$$$::She appears to have hit the nail on the head.::
1151::$$$message_0005_0034_0000$$$::"Huh? You're kidding, Saber. You were enjoying takoyaki before."::
1152::$$$message_0005_0035_0000$$$::She ate all the takoyaki I brought her as thanks for watching the house.[lr]::
1153::$$$message_0005_0035_0001$$$::She even finished it all before Sakura could say that she wanted some, too.::
1154::$$$message_0005_0036_0000$$$::"I-it can't be... You're telling me that contained that slimy, puffy sea monster from another realm!?"::
1155::$$$message_0005_0037_0000$$$::"Slimy, puffy...?"[lr]::
1156::$$$message_0005_0037_0001$$$::Well, I can't exactly say no... Does she have something against octopi?::
1157::$$$message_0005_0038_0000$$$::"I can't believe you, [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服08a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=500][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服08a(中) textoff=0]Shirou."[lr]::
1158::$$$message_0005_0038_0001$$$::She's trembling and looking at me with a ghastly expression. Is she actually mad at me?[wm canskip=0]::
1159::$$$message_0005_0039_0000$$$::"Wait, Saber. So you really can't eat octopus? I watched you eat it before."[lr]::
1160::$$$message_0005_0039_0001$$$::"I-I had no idea that this 'octopus' you speak of was that sea monster![lr]::
1161::$$$message_0005_0039_0002$$$::...I can't believe I've actually been putting those undying-even-when-I-split-them-in-two dark gods from another realm into my mouth...!"[lr]::
1162::$$$message_0005_0039_0003$$$::Another realm? Dark gods? That's just an exaggeration.::
1163::$$$message_0005_0040_0000$$$::"What will you do, Shirou? Saber seems to be against this."[lr]::
1164::$$$message_0005_0040_0001$$$::"Yeah[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服20a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服20a(中) textoff=0]..."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
1165::$$$message_0005_0040_0002$$$::As if [chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01c(中) textoff=0]it had come back to life after leaving the refrigerator, [retainhaze][movefg textoff=0 both=1 opacity=155 left=-244 top=-100 time=600 accel=0 storage=049_黒炎][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服08c(中) textoff=0]the octopus begins to wrap its tentacles around my arm.[wm canskip=0]::
1166::$$$message_0005_0041_0000$$$::"A-and Rider, [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvl][wm canskip=0][stophaze][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01a(中) textoff=0]how can you bear to eat something like that!?"[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvs][clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=049_黒炎][lr]::
1167::$$$message_0005_0041_0001$$$::Her eyes seem to scream that she thought their shared continent must have engendered some kind of camaraderie.::
1168::$$$message_0005_0042_0000$$$::"I am not picky about eating sea creatures.[lr]::
1169::$$$message_0005_0042_0001$$$::From my point of view, I have a similarly hard time believing that you can enjoy natto and salted plum."[lr]::
1170::$$$message_0005_0042_0002$$$::Rider's eyes return the same sentiment, with the addition of an accusation of bad taste.::
1171::$$$message_0005_0043_0000$$$::...So she does admit to having foods she dislikes.[lr]::
1172::$$$message_0005_0043_0001$$$::I've heard that foreigners who aren't used to natto and pickled plum tend to regard them poorly, and it seems that Rider is no exception.::
1173::$$$message_0005_0044_0000$$$::"...Hmph. They surprised me at first, but they are still delectable compared to the cheese or dried food we ate during war."[lr]::
1174::$$$message_0005_0044_0001$$$::Ah, that makes sense. Fermented foods are no match for that I suppose.::
1175::$$$message_0005_0045_0000$$$::While feeling impressed by Saber's life experience, [se storage=se420.wav][se storage=se419.wav][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=2]I peel the octopus off my hand and put it on the cutting board.[lr]::
1176::$$$message_0005_0045_0001$$$::Neither Saber nor Rider are paying any attention to my actions anymore.::
1177::$$$message_0005_0046_0000$$$::"And what about the way you drench your food in olive oil? It smothers all the qualities of the food."[lr]::
1178::$$$message_0005_0046_0001$$$::[fg left=0 opacity=0 index=500 top=0 time=200 storage=black textoff=0][movefg opacity=80 left=0 top=0 time=800 accel=0 storage=black textoff=0]Ahh... Rider does frequently add olive oil to her food.[wm canskip=0]::
1179::$$$message_0005_0047_0000$$$::"I'm free to enjoy my meals the way I see fit.[lr]::
1180::$$$message_0005_0047_0001$$$::To begin with, we are Servants. [cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01d(中) textoff=0][movefg opacity=170 left=0 top=0 time=800 accel=0 storage=black textoff=0]It makes no sense to be so scrupulous about food when we don't even need to eat.[lr]::
1181::$$$message_0005_0047_0002$$$::Saber, I sometimes find your preferences to be rather shallow."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
1182::$$$message_0005_0047_0003$$$::"Oh? Are you saying dressing up as a store clerk, out of your desire to own a bicycle or a motorcycle, isn't shallow for a Servant then?"::
1183::$$$message_0005_0048_0000$$$::...!?[lr]::
1184::$$$message_0005_0048_0001$$$::Man, I was so focused on cooking that I didn't realize what a debacle this is turning into![lr]::
1185::$$$message_0005_0048_0002$$$::This is bad. I can see either my beloved house or this whole area being reduced to rubble if I don't do something fast...!::
1186::$$$message_0005_0049_0000$$$::"Senpai, I'll help you make lunch."[lr]::
1187::$$$message_0005_0049_0001$$$::"Sakura...! Great timing![lr]::
1188::$$$message_0005_0049_0002$$$::I-I'm good right now, but can you stop Saber and Rider?"[lr]::
1189::$$$message_0005_0049_0003$$$::"Uh, okay...[seloop storage=se373.wav][wvl canskip=false time=400][sestop time=3000 nowait=1][clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から pos=all textoff=0] Oh Rider, what are you doing with Saber now?[lr]::
1190::$$$message_0005_0049_0004$$$::...Don't tell me you're about to break the table over a petty argument like the other day?"::
1191::$$$message_0005_0050_0000$$$::"S-Sakura!?[lr]::
1192::$$$message_0005_0050_0001$$$::N-no, it's nothing serious.[lr]::
1193::$$$message_0005_0050_0002$$$::Right, Saber? We were just discussing our culinary preferences[line len=2]"[lr]::
1194::$$$message_0005_0050_0003$$$::"Y-yes, of course, Rider![lr]::
1195::$$$message_0005_0050_0004$$$::We were encouraging each other to try the unique flavors of Japan's dried foods!"::
1196::$$$message_0005_0051_0000$$$::Their defense sure is slapdash.[lr]::
1197::$$$message_0005_0051_0001$$$::"...Maybe they'll learn a thing or two, at least."[lr]::
1198::$$$message_0005_0051_0002$$$::I thank Sakura as she starts lecturing them and begin cutting the ingredients.[lr]::
1199::$$$message_0005_0051_0003$$$::I'll prepare some natto and dried fish too, just to make things fair.::
1200::$$$message_0005_0052_0000$$$::Now...[lr]::
1201::$$$message_0005_0052_0001$$$::Why don't we make these two each face their weaknesses, as a mutual step towards improving their friendship?::
901132::$$$message_9005_0027_0000$$$::"Shirou, what is this?"[r]�#�